Cablegram is conceptually inspired in part by:

Suffice
Eduardo J. Barrios
https://github.com/edujbarrios/suffice

Suffice explores minimum successful token budgets under task-quality
constraints. Cablegram explores the related problem of minimum sufficient
representations for communication.

Caveman
https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman

Caveman inspired aspects of Cablegram's exploration of concise communication
for AI coding agents.

